I sit at the table with a pen and paper.
I need to make a grocery list.
I play the cooking video on the phone again.
I listen to the video very carefully.
The chef in the video tells the exact quantities.
He says, "First, take half a kilo of thick poha."
I write 'half a kilo of thick poha' on my list.
Then he says, "Take a quarter kilo of onions."
I also add 'a quarter kilo of onions' to the list.
After that, the chef talks about peanuts.
He says, "Take a small bowl of raw peanuts."
Then he talks about the spices.
The chef says, "After that, take two spoons of oil and one spoon of mustard seeds."
"And then take half a spoon of turmeric."
I check the spices in my kitchen.
I have oil, mustard seeds, and turmeric.
So I do not write them on my list.
My shopping list is now ready.
Now I go outside to buy the groceries.
